{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15235010","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15235010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1523501001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, it's been a while!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9A02A1108C39D954","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, it's been a while!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, it's been a while!","variant_male_record_index":"190305","variant_female_record_index":"190306","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1523501001":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, it's been a while!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，好久不见！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9A02A1108C39D954","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, it's been a while!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, it's been a while!","variant_male_record_index":"190305","variant_female_record_index":"190306","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1523501002:1":{"text":"Hah... is it that obvious?","source_cn":"唔……有那么明显吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6915BE4D27B58B78","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hah... is it that obvious?","female":"Hah... is it that obvious?","variant_male_record_index":"190307","variant_female_record_index":"190308","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1523501003:1":{"text":"Well, I have good reason to be—we've found an herbalist!","source_cn":"因为今天护卫传来了好消息——总算找到合适的植物学者了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x02B338053D8079D7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Well, I have good reason to be—we've found an herbalist!","female":"Well, I have good reason to be—we've found an herbalist!","variant_male_record_index":"190309","variant_female_record_index":"190310","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1523501005:1":{"text":"There aren't any locals fit for the task, but I got a reply from Sylane. A scholar there is interested in helping with our research.","source_cn":"呼临城内没有合适的学者，但前几天希莱城给我回信，说有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E6AC30D34B6C2FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1523501006:1":{"text":"Let's see... The scholar will be arriving in just a couple of days!","source_cn":"我算算……这位学者现在应该已经在来呼临城的路上了，用不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4048C0F040DE313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1523501007:1":{"text":"Once the research is completed, the protests will naturally die down.","source_cn":"等到苦苞穗改良工作全部完成，抗议的问题将会迎刃而解。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC372EFC0DEF6DEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1523501008:0":{"text":"Peace will finally return to Halia for good...","source_cn":"呼临终于要迎来长久的稳定了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x732D7B7B95AE8FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1523501009:1":{"text":"Regulus! There's an emergency outside the city!","source_cn":"——殿下！报告殿下！城外出现了紧急情况！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FF1FF4469F00E0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1523501010:0":{"text":"Don't panic. What's going on?","source_cn":"不要慌慌张张的。怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB83F4BD0C1BA3B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1523501011:0":{"text":"It's... Councilman Aurelin. He's rallied an army and is threatening to attack the city <style=\"highlight\">unless you step down</style>.","source_cn":"是……奥勒留议事官。他在城外聚集士兵，扬言要用武力强攻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D2016F3655A9BE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1523501012:0":{"text":"The rest of us have followed the captain to the city gate, but we're outnumbered... We... might not be able to hold much longer!","source_cn":"队长已经带着卫队到了城门，但对面人数太多，恐怕……恐怕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478117BCAD38610F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1523501013:0":{"text":"Aurelin... He's at it again!","source_cn":"奥勒留……又是他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ECFD7B62CA934E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1523501013":{"text":"Aurelin... He's at it again!","source_cn":"奥勒留……又是他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ECFD7B62CA934E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1523501016:0":{"text":"Regulus, please stay here while I...","source_cn":"殿下，您先留在此处，我去城外——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B13EE780CBB168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1523501017:1":{"text":"Freeze! This is the Regulus' chamber! How dare you...","source_cn":"不许动！前方是领主殿下的居所，你们怎敢——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26BA3FD17D99B247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1523501018:0":{"text":"Ah!!!","source_cn":"——啊！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F21CE43F87854B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1523501019:0":{"text":"Step down now, you coward!","source_cn":"懦弱无能的领主，交出领主之位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8497D59F5DF428F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1523501020:0":{"text":"I'll seize the city by force if you resist!","source_cn":"若再不从，我将带兵攻下此处！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B3E6AF1DC7F702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1523501021:0":{"text":"Don't even think about it!","source_cn":"你休想——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2551DDD323ED9CFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1523501022:0":{"text":"Aurelin, you're committing treason!","source_cn":"奥勒留，你带兵攻城，是谋逆重罪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A4152A73F506CF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1523501023:0":{"text":"This is your final warning! As your colleague for decades, if you stand down now, I can persuade the Regulus to spare your life!","source_cn":"看在这么多年同僚的情面上，我最后警告你一次，就此收手！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7281A6BEBD537DCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1523501024:1":{"text":"You ignorant fool! No one can stop me from saving Halia!","source_cn":"愚昧！任何人都休想阻止我拯救呼临！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD5CFE8C73EB0BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1523501025:1":{"text":"Save Halia?! You're doing the exact opposite of it!","source_cn":"什么拯救！你才是想摧毁呼临！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x927720703C1EE3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1523501026:1":{"text":"I've found an herbalist who can help us modify the bitter corn.","source_cn":"我已经找到了合适的学者，只需要一段时间就能完成苦苞穗的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x170023A25A02930C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1523501027:1":{"text":"If everything goes well, the Wildborn will lose their leverage over us through food, and you'll have no reason to protest!","source_cn":"食物不会再成为雅库伯尔牵制呼临的手段，停战合约的弊端也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB45A6AE100E64F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1523501028:1":{"text":"Retreat now, Aurelin, while you still can!","source_cn":"退兵吧，奥勒留，趁你还有回头的余地！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC065A5088029D0D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1523501029:1":{"text":"Retreat? You must be joking...","source_cn":"退兵？哈，哈哈哈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB56DD38A94DC607D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1523501030:1":{"text":"Bakis, you're as rigid as ever.","source_cn":"比博，你果然永远都是这么顽固古板。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC46A332176FD60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1523501031:1":{"text":"If I retreat now, then what? Go back to serving a naive child and carrying out his absurd policies? I'm done playing that game.","source_cn":"就算我现在退兵，之后又如何？继续和你一起扮演愚蠢的臣子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50A5FF5CF4FB2BEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1523501032:1":{"text":"Herennus had been wise his whole life, but lost his clarity on his deathbed! Abundius isn't a worthy successor!","source_cn":"赫伦尼英明一世，死时却犯了糊涂！从一开始，阿邦德就不配...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD88877DE133D0D07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1523501033:1":{"text":"When he hesitated to wage war against the Wildborn, he proved himself unfit for the title!","source_cn":"——早在他犹犹豫豫，不愿对兽人开战时，他就该让位了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A6DABA801F2EB7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:50:1523501033":{"text":"When he hesitated to wage war against the Wildborn, he proved himself unfit for the title!","source_cn":"——早在他犹犹豫豫，不愿对兽人开战时，他就该让位了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A6DABA801F2EB7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1523501034:1":{"text":"Indeed, and I stand by my decision!","source_cn":"是。那又如何！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9ADB814F05822807","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Indeed, and I stand by my decision!","female":"Indeed, and I stand by my decision!","variant_male_record_index":"190345","variant_female_record_index":"190346","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1523501036:1":{"text":"Count yourself lucky to have a student like Perseus! If it weren't for him, I'd have taken over Halia long ago!","source_cn":"要不是比博你教出了珀尔修斯这个好学生，以一己之力统率军...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2459F19BDCA75FD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1523501037:1":{"text":"Now that Perseus is dead, no one can stand in my way anymore!","source_cn":"现在好了，珀尔修斯死了！再也没有人能骑在我头上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01447745B120B739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1523501038:1":{"text":"I bow to no one—not you, Bakis, nor Abundius!","source_cn":"你——比博！还有他——阿邦德！谁也别妄想再压我一头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x589C6BA616705662","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1523501039:1":{"text":"Just as I expected, the truce agreement is nothing but your excuse to stage a rebellion.","source_cn":"果真如此……抗议停战合约，果然只是一个幌子、一个借口。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3E3D4036E389626","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1523501040:1":{"text":"You've been <style=\"highlight\">eyeing the throne</style> all along!","source_cn":"你真正的目的，从一开始就是要<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC610664F6C80A0BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1523501041:1":{"text":"My father trusted you so much... How could you seize his city?!","source_cn":"我父亲那么信任你……呼临城是他建立的，你怎么能夺取他的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87AB4302948A4DF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1523501042:1":{"text":"I'm not taking it from Herennus, I'm taking it from you!","source_cn":"我不是在夺赫伦尼的东西，我是在抢你的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF575D755FA0FF6D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1523501043:1":{"text":"Everyone, push forw